From 60088593fc1141251ea302b8a13da5f1fbab2abb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ammar ELWazir <3832908+ammarwa@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 14:25:32 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] hipBLASLt: accept explicitly requested gfx1250-strict

Allow explicit strict-target builds past tensilelite_validate_gpu_targets. Keep the default all target list unchanged. This addresses the configuration rejection only; generated kernels still require build validation.

Observed in https://github.com/ROCm/TheRock/actions/runs/34634887721/job/103383110591 . Temporary downstream validation patch; upstream submission pending.
---
 .../hipblaslt/cmake/tensilelite_supported_architectures.cmake    | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/projects/hipblaslt/cmake/tensilelite_supported_architectures.cmake b/projects/hipblaslt/cmake/tensilelite_supported_architectures.cmake
index 4c910c9..5d85fb7 100644
--- a/projects/hipblaslt/cmake/tensilelite_supported_architectures.cmake
+++ b/projects/hipblaslt/cmake/tensilelite_supported_architectures.cmake
@@ -18,6 +18,7 @@ set(SUPPORTED_ARCHITECTURES
     "gfx1200"
     "gfx1201"
     "gfx1250"
+    "gfx1250-strict"
     "gfx908:xnack+"
     "gfx908:xnack-"
     "gfx90a:xnack+"
-- 
2.43.0

